# The three paths blog posts used to live at. Each one still holds a page that
# meta-refreshes to the current URL, which works but tells a crawler nothing; a 301
# moves the inbound links properly. The pages stay in place behind these as a
# fallback.

/temp_blog/* /introducing-axis/ 301
/temp_blog2/* /introducing-axis/ 301
/muon/* /blogs/muon/ 301
